*** CONFLICT RESOLUTION ***
Some of The-Warzone-2100-Project additional terms are restrictions that conflict with the permissions granted by Eidos.
For those cases, Eidos terms have precedence over The-Warzone-2100-Project terms, which are rendered null and void to the extent of the inconsistency.

See:
- COPYING.SECTION7.Eidos.Additional-terms
- COPYING.SECTION7.The-Warzone-2100-Project.Additional-terms-for-attribution-and-origin
